### 查询eth余额
POST http://localhost:8545
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "eth_getBalance",
  "params": [
    "0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266",
    "latest"
  ],
  "id": 1
}

### 调用counter合约 的number1 方法，结果是21
POST http://localhost:8545
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "eth_call",
  "params": [
    {
      "to": "0xCf7Ed3AccA5a467e9e704C703E8D87F634fB0Fc9",
      "data": "0xc223a39e"
    },
    "latest"
  ],
  "id": 1
}